  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "新鞋"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;作者：<b>張寶明</b></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">我無皮鞋、無涼鞋，kan-na一雙球鞋niā-niā，出外一定穿伊出門。Loh-tso̍h--日去上班ê路--裡落雨，鞋仔踏水踏kah siûnn糊糊，辦公室無淺拖仔thang換，規个人真礙虐，一直ak-tsak--起-來。姑不二三將，專心上課轉移心思mài去tshap--伊，下課kap囡仔開講練痟話度時間mài去想--伊。Siáng知，人若leh衰，種pû仔生菜瓜，peh樓梯ê時鞋頭去踢著頂kuân坎仔，suah開大喙，真無ta-uâ，ná tshê ná行，入去教室激厚面皮kā導師借兩條樹奶束leh鞋頭，害我見笑規工。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">下班食飯飽，緊去siòng一間排khah濟球鞋ê店，憑頭仔看有kah意--ê--無，心--裡kan-na一直想beh揣kap歹--去ê hit雙仝樣--ê。揣規半間去--ah，tsiah想著歹--去ê hit雙是兩年前ê樣，tsit-má時行tsiah緊，hit型--ê早就淘汰--ah。就án-ne放下堅持ê「過去」，tsiah甘願揣心內「真正」kah意--ê。拄好店leh拍折大優待，買兩雙lóng拍六折。好，有tsit kái見笑代ê教示，殘殘豆乾切五角，參茸--ê kuānn--幾-罐-仔，kā買兩雙。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tso̍h--日先穿hit雙我khah kah意ê白球鞋，配khóng色ê短褲tsat仔kah白襪仔，hiánn目kah beh死--去，害我見著人lóng感覺無意無意，也莫怪囡仔見見（kiàn-kìnn）一个to huah：「Őo-óo……，老師穿新鞋！」Khah大粒膽--ê、大面神--ê ē suà leh講：「Ài踏三下！」我滾sńg笑激笑笑仔講：「是按怎新鞋ài踏三下，若講ē出道理，隨hōo你踏。」逐家走了了，無人敢tshînn倚--來，真好佳哉。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">昨hng，頭節課下課to iáu未行出教室，一陣屁that仔kā我圍--leh，查埔查某lóng有，真āng聲講：「阮查著新鞋ài hông踏三下ê理由--ah。」我當做凊彩講講--ê，kā pué--開beh行出教室。「第一，新鞋siunn tīng，ài踏hōo軟khah好穿。」「第二，看人穿新鞋目空赤，kā踏hōo烏thang tháu鬱氣。」「第三，人講新鞋tài穢氣（uè-khì），ài kā踏走。」一句來一句去，我lóng bē赴應：「Tio̍h！有道理。」可憐ê白鞋仔m̄知hōo猴死囡仔踏幾下去--ah，koh講踏三下niâ！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">原來，有人去問『谷哥』khoo規陣同學beh來創治--我。好！Tsiah認真，輸--lín！&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>#逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報319期，2020年10月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMH